      description: 'Theory-level predictions preregistered on OSF: DOI 10.17605/OSF.IO/P8CKQ, registered 8 September 2026 (version 1.100), updated 13 September 2026 (version 1.102), twenty-two propositions. Companion: Register · The ARC Theory · Operational Definitions, version 1.9.1, 5 October 2026.'
  abstract: |
    This document provides a master table of contents, reading guide, timeline, key results summary, and glossary for the complete ARC Theory Paper Suite. It serves as the entry point for navigating the full research programme, listing all papers in recommended reading order with cross-references, and defining the technical terminology used throughout the suite.

